  "referenceSource": "def solve(loads, groups):\n    lo, hi = max(loads), sum(loads)\n    while lo < hi:\n        mid = (lo+hi)//2; used = 1; current = 0\n        for load in loads:\n            if current + load > mid: used += 1; current = 0\n            current += load\n        if used <= groups: hi = mid\n        else: lo = mid+1\n    return lo\nclass Solution:\n    def splitLoad(self, loads, groups):\n        return solve(loads, groups)\n"
}
